#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:4
msgid "数据集上传"
msgstr "Dataset upload"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:7
msgid "简介"
msgstr "Introduction"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:8
msgid ""
"数据上传模块用于将工作流收集和处理后的图像和预测上传到DaoAI世界数据集。该模块方便用户将AI自动标注好的数据同步到DaoAI "
"World平台，便于后续的数据管理和模型训练。通过配置上传参数，用户可以灵活控制上传频率和数据量，实现高效的数据存储和管理。"
msgstr ""
"The data upload module is used to upload the images and predictions "
"collected and processed by the workflow to the DaoAI world dataset.This "
"module facilitates users to synchronize AI automatically labeled data to the"
" DaoAI World platform to facilitate subsequent data management and model "
"training.By configuring upload parameters, users can flexibly control the "
"upload frequency and data volume to achieve efficient data storage and "
"management."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:17
msgid "输入 / 输出"
msgstr "input/output"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:19
msgid "输入：图像 + 预测模型结果"
msgstr "Input: Image + Predictive Model Results"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:21
msgid "输出：上传到指定UID的DaoAI World数据集"
msgstr "Output: DaoAI World dataset uploaded to the specified UID"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:24
#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:30
msgid "参数"
msgstr "parameter"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:31
msgid "说明"
msgstr "illustrate"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:32
msgid "默认值/ ``示例``"
msgstr "Default/ ``example``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:33
msgid "**节点名称**"
msgstr "**Node name**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:34
msgid "步骤名称，用于标识该节点的唯一标识符"
msgstr "Step name, a unique identifier used to identify this node"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:35
msgid "``dataset_upload_1``"
msgstr "``dataset_upload_1``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:36
msgid "**备注**"
msgstr "**Remark**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:37
msgid "可选的备注信息，用于描述该步骤的用途"
msgstr "Optional remarks describing the purpose of this step"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:38
#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:71
msgid "``留空``"
msgstr "``leave blank``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:39
msgid "**输入图像**"
msgstr "**Input image**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:40
msgid "指定输入图像的来源，尽量保持为原始 ``input.image`` 以确保图片数据的完整性"
msgstr ""
"Specify the source of the input image, try to keep it as the original "
"``input.image`` to ensure the integrity of the image data"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:41
msgid "``input.image``"
msgstr "``input.image``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:42
msgid "**目标项目**"
msgstr "**Target Project**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:43
msgid ""
"选择要上传到的DaoAI World数据集的UID，UID一般为url的第二个 ``/`` 后面的部分. (例如: "
"daoai.com/Keqg_LLfOQciTF2DFv1irg/ **PvIwJC6jg5tEWJUfdCaveg**/upload )"
msgstr ""
"Select the UID of the DaoAI World data set to be uploaded to. The UID is "
"generally the second part of the URL after ``/``. (For example: "
"daoai.com/Keqg_LLfOQciTF2DFv1irg/ **PvIwJC6jg5tEWJUfdCaveg**/upload )"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:44
msgid "``PvIwJC6jg5tEWJUfdCaveg``"
msgstr "``PvIwJC6jg5tEWJUfdCaveg``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:45
msgid "**预测显示**"
msgstr "**Forecast Display**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:46
msgid "选择要上传的模型预测结果，通常选择检测模型的输出"
msgstr ""
"Select the model prediction results to upload, usually the output of the "
"detection model"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:47
msgid "``detection_filter_1 predictions``"
msgstr "``detection_filter_1 predictions``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:48
msgid "**数据百分比**"
msgstr "**Data Percentage**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:49
msgid "设置保存数据的百分比，范围0-100，随机上传百分比的数据来控制上传的数据量"
msgstr ""
"Set the percentage of saved data, ranging from 0-100, and randomly upload "
"the percentage of data to control the amount of uploaded data."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:50
#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:56
msgid "``100``"
msgstr "``100``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:51
msgid "**每分钟使用限制**"
msgstr "**Per minute usage limit**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:52
msgid "设置每分钟上传的最大图像数量，防止上传过快导致服务器压力过大"
msgstr ""
"Set the maximum number of images uploaded per minute to prevent excessive "
"server pressure caused by uploading too quickly"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:53
msgid "``10``"
msgstr "``10``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:54
msgid "**每小时使用限制**"
msgstr "**Hourly usage limit**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:55
msgid "设置每小时上传的最大图像数量，防止上传过快导致服务器压力过大"
msgstr ""
"Set the maximum number of images uploaded per hour to prevent excessive "
"server pressure caused by uploading too quickly"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:57
msgid "**每日使用限制**"
msgstr "**Daily usage limit**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:58
msgid "设置每日上传的最大图像数量，防止上传过快导致服务器压力过大"
msgstr ""
"Set the maximum number of images uploaded daily to prevent excessive server "
"pressure caused by uploading too quickly"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:59
msgid "``1000``"
msgstr "``1000``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:60
msgid "**使用配额名称**"
msgstr "**Use quota name**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:61
msgid "用于追踪使用配额的唯一标识符，保持默认即可"
msgstr "Unique identifier used to track usage quota, just leave it as default"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:62
msgid "``ggbond``"
msgstr "``ggbond``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:63
msgid "**最大图像尺寸**"
msgstr "**Maximum image size**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:64
msgid "设置上传图像的最大尺寸，超过该尺寸的图像将被缩放以节省存储空间"
msgstr ""
"Set the maximum size of uploaded images, images exceeding this size will be "
"scaled to save storage space"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:65
msgid "``[1920,1080]``"
msgstr "``[1920,1080]``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:66
msgid "**压缩级别**"
msgstr "**Compression Level**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:67
msgid "设置图像压缩级别，范围1-100，值越大图像质量越高但文件越大"
msgstr ""
"Set the image compression level, ranging from 1-100. The larger the value, "
"the higher the image quality but the larger the file size."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:68
msgid "``85``"
msgstr "``85``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:69
msgid "**注册标签**"
msgstr "**Register Tag**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:70
msgid "给开发人员用来设置的标签，一般保持为空即可"
msgstr "A label for developers to set. Generally, it can be left empty."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:72
msgid "**保留预测**"
msgstr "**HOLD PREDICTION**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:73
msgid "是否将模型预测结果与图像一同保存，一般保持为True即可"
msgstr ""
"Whether to save the model prediction results together with the image, "
"generally keep it as True"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:74
#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:80
msgid "``True``"
msgstr "``True``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:75
msgid "**禁用接收器**"
msgstr "**Disable Receiver**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:76
msgid "布尔标志以禁用区块执行，保持默认False即可"
msgstr "Boolean flag to disable block execution, keep the default False"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:77
msgid "``False``"
msgstr "``False``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:78
msgid "**即发即忘**"
msgstr "**Send it and forget it**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:79
msgid "布尔标志用于多路复用执行，启用后区块不会等待上传完成再继续执行下游区块，保持默认True即可最大化执行效率"
msgstr ""
"The Boolean flag is used for multiplexed execution. When enabled, the block "
"will not wait for the upload to complete before continuing to execute "
"downstream blocks. Keeping the default True can maximize execution "
"efficiency."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:81
msgid "**标注批次前缀**"
msgstr "**Mark batch prefix**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:82
msgid "用于为上传的图像分配批次名称的前缀，便于后续数据管理"
msgstr ""
"Prefix used to assign batch names to uploaded images to facilitate "
"subsequent data management"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:83
msgid "``auto_batch_``"
msgstr "``auto_batch_``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:84
msgid "**标注批次创建频率**"
msgstr "**Mark batch creation frequency**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:85
msgid "设置创建新标注批次的频率，可选包括：从不（never），每天（daily），每周（weekly），每月（monthly）"
msgstr ""
"Set the frequency of creating new annotation batches, options include: "
"never, daily, weekly, monthly"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:86
msgid "``daily``"
msgstr "``daily``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:89
msgid "使用步骤"
msgstr "Usage steps"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:91
msgid "在工作流编辑器中添加本模块。"
msgstr "Add this module in the workflow editor."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:92
msgid "输入DaoAI数据集UID。"
msgstr "Enter the DaoAI dataset UID."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:93
msgid "设置上传间隔，点击保存。"
msgstr "Set the upload interval and click Save."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:96
msgid "注意事项"
msgstr "Things to note"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:98
msgid "配置完后，启用工作流开始数据上传。"
msgstr "After configuration, enable the workflow to start data upload."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/data_storage/dataset_upload.rst:99
msgid ""
"如果不知道预测结果符不符合要求时，可以先点击右上角的 ``测试`` 来用单张图像测试效果。图像会上传到DaoAI World数据集，方便查看效果。"
msgstr ""
"If you don't know that the prediction result does not meet the requirements,"
" you can first click \"Test\" in the upper right corner to test the effect "
"with a single image.The image will be uploaded to the DaoAI World data set "
"for easy viewing of the effect."
